    "H/h last-wins, L/l last-wins, q supersedes normal output and selected-match error precedence",
    "c/l/L/o/m/v/contexts output selection, counts, empty matches and trailing context",
    "A/B/C/numeric context order, explicit C0 grouping, separator/no-separator order",
    "r/R/d/device ordering and command-line versus interior symlink/special-file behavior",
    "include/exclude/exclude-from ordered last-matching filter and first-filter default",
    "a/I/binary-files ordering, NUL/invalid encoding classification, z versus Z",
    "e/f and empty/newline/duplicate patterns, stdin pattern file ownership",
    "help/version/color-invalid plus valid or invalid options and missing operands",
    "TTY and TERM auto/never/always color, GREP_COLORS, no explicit color option",
    "stdin regular-file seek position versus pipe ownership under m/q/l/L"
  ],
