      "contract": "LF/NUL, ASCII/Unicode folding, empty/punctuation/repeated/newline/file pattern sources, color/empty colors, context/max-count/inverse and repeated operands preserve the independently observed GNU bytes. Private Bash cases require actual rg and candidate-only span evaluation; original GNU routing is not credited.",
      "tests": [
